  "method": "The Profitability Index (PI) is calculated by dividing the Present Value (PV) of future cash flows by the initial investment. The formula for PI is PI = PV / Initial Investment, where PV is the present value of future cash flows, discounted by the cost of capital or discount rate, and Initial Investment is the initial amount invested in the project.",
